WEBVTT

00:00:13.526 --> 00:00:15.310
Yeah!

00:00:16.921 --> 00:00:18.401
Oh, come on.

00:00:21.795 --> 00:00:23.406
[Toothless chomping]

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.976
Uh...
No, thanks. I'm good.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.413
[dragons shriek]

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.420
[snarling]

00:00:44.296 --> 00:00:46.733
- [snaps]
- [both growling]

00:00:51.477 --> 00:00:53.305
[snarling]

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.439
[huffing bellow]

00:00:57.222 --> 00:00:59.442
[growling]

00:01:01.922 --> 00:01:03.271
[squeaks]

00:01:05.448 --> 00:01:08.799
Huh. Not so fireproof
on the inside, are you?

00:01:08.973 --> 00:01:10.235
Here you go.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.769
[purring]

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:30.995
Everything we know
about you guys is wrong.

00:01:38.916 --> 00:01:41.005
[footsteps approach]

00:01:41.179 --> 00:01:44.269
Dad! You're back!
Uh, Gobber's not here so...

00:01:44.443 --> 00:01:45.313
[Stoick] I know.

00:01:48.229 --> 00:01:49.709
I came looking for you.

00:01:49.883 --> 00:01:51.015
You did?

00:01:51.189 --> 00:01:52.364
You've been keeping secrets.

00:01:52.538 --> 00:01:54.453
[stammers] I have?

00:01:54.627 --> 00:01:56.760
Just how long did you think
you could hide it?

00:01:56.934 --> 00:02:00.067
I... I... I don't know
what you're...

00:02:00.241 --> 00:02:04.028
Nothing happens on this island
without me hearing about it.

00:02:04.202 --> 00:02:06.160
- Oh?
- So...

00:02:07.205 --> 00:02:09.076
...let's talk...

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.035
...about that dragon.

00:02:11.209 --> 00:02:15.561
Oh, gods. Dad, I'm so sorry.
I... I was going to tell you.

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:18.390
- I just didn't know how to...
- [chuckling]

00:02:18.564 --> 00:02:21.393
- [laughing]
- [nervous laughter]

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:25.223
You're...
You're not upset?

00:02:25.397 --> 00:02:27.878
What?!
I was hoping for this!

00:02:28.052 --> 00:02:29.401
Uh... You were?

00:02:29.575 --> 00:02:31.577
And believe me,
it only gets better!

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:34.406
Wait till you spill
a Nadder's
guts the first time!

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.540
And mount your first
Gronckle head on a spear!

00:02:37.714 --> 00:02:41.500
What a feeling!
You really had me
going there, son!

00:02:41.674 --> 00:02:46.200
All those years
of the worst Viking
Berk has ever seen.

00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:49.334
Odin, it was rough.
I almost gave up on you.

00:02:49.508 --> 00:02:51.423
And all the while
you were holding out on me!

00:02:51.597 --> 00:02:55.122
Oh, Thor Almighty! [sighs]

00:02:55.296 --> 00:02:57.560
With you doing so well
in the ring...

00:02:59.126 --> 00:03:01.868
...we finally have
something to talk about.

00:03:14.011 --> 00:03:15.273
Oh.

00:03:15.447 --> 00:03:19.190
Here, I, uh,
I brought you something,

00:03:19.364 --> 00:03:22.149
to keep you safe
in the ring.

00:03:22.323 --> 00:03:24.325
Wow. Thanks.

00:03:24.499 --> 00:03:27.111
Your mother would have
wanted you to have it.

00:03:27.285 --> 00:03:30.897
- It's half of
her breastplate.
- [nervous chuckle]

00:03:31.071 --> 00:03:35.119
Matching set.
It keeps her close, you know.

00:03:35.293 --> 00:03:38.296
Wear it proudly.
You deserve it.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.298
You've held up
your end of the deal.

00:03:45.433 --> 00:03:48.132
[yawns] I should
really get to bed.

00:03:48.306 --> 00:03:50.264
Yes, good. OK, good talk.

00:03:50.438 --> 00:03:52.353
I'll see you back
at the house.

00:03:52.527 --> 00:03:54.617
Thanks for stopping by...

00:03:54.791 --> 00:03:57.620
- ...and for the breast hat.
- I hope you like the hat.

00:03:57.794 --> 00:03:59.317
[clears throat]

00:03:59.491 --> 00:04:01.624
Well, uh... Yep.
Good night.

00:04:03.538 --> 00:04:06.629
- [sighs]
- [exhales]

00:04:11.024 --> 00:04:13.287
[cheering]

00:04:16.595 --> 00:04:19.163
Stay out of my way!
I'm winning this thing.

00:04:19.337 --> 00:04:22.427
Please, by all means.

00:04:23.733 --> 00:04:25.299
[dragon growls]

00:04:34.265 --> 00:04:36.484
This time,
this time for sure!

00:04:37.398 --> 00:04:39.705
[screams]

00:04:41.185 --> 00:04:43.970
- [snoring]
- [crowd cheering]

00:04:46.103 --> 00:04:49.410
No! No, son of a half-troll,
rat-eating, munge-bucket!

00:04:49.584 --> 00:04:50.934
[Stoick] Wait! Wait.

00:04:51.108 --> 00:04:53.240
- So, later.
- Oh! Not so fast.

00:04:53.414 --> 00:04:55.373
- I'm kind of late for...
- What?!

00:04:55.547 --> 00:04:58.202
Late for what, exactly?

00:04:58.376 --> 00:05:00.595
Quiet down!
The elder has decided.

00:05:04.295 --> 00:05:06.732
[crowd gasps, murmurs]

00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:12.433
[crowd cheering]

00:05:12.607 --> 00:05:16.176
You've done it, Hiccup!
You get to kill the dragon!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.657
- [cheering]
- Yeah!

00:05:19.789 --> 00:05:21.225
That's my boy!

00:05:21.399 --> 00:05:25.098
Yeah. Yes. I can't wait.
I am so...

00:05:25.272 --> 00:05:27.100
...leaving!
We're leaving.

00:05:27.274 --> 00:05:28.885
Let's pack up.

00:05:29.059 --> 00:05:31.539
Looks like you and me are
taking a little vacation.

00:05:32.236 --> 00:05:33.585
Forever.

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.632
[sighs] Oh, man.

00:05:39.156 --> 00:05:40.461
[gasps] What the...?!

00:05:40.635 --> 00:05:43.073
[stammers]
What are you doing here?

00:05:43.247 --> 00:05:46.032
I want to know
what's going on.

00:05:46.206 --> 00:05:50.428
No one just gets as good
as you do. Especially you.

00:05:50.602 --> 00:05:53.605
Start talking!
Are you training with someone?

00:05:53.779 --> 00:05:56.303
- Training? [stammers]
- It better not involve this.

00:05:56.477 --> 00:05:59.089
I know this looks
really bad, but you see...

00:05:59.263 --> 00:06:01.352
- [twig snaps]
- This is, uh... Aaah!

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:04.442
You're right. You're right.
You're right.

00:06:04.616 --> 00:06:06.313
I'm through
with the lies.

00:06:06.487 --> 00:06:10.056
I've been making outfits.
So you got me.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:13.277
It's time everyone knew.
Drag me back, go ahead.

00:06:13.451 --> 00:06:16.323
Here we go... Ow!
Why would you do that?!

00:06:16.497 --> 00:06:20.719
That's for the lies.
And that's
for everything else.

00:06:20.893 --> 00:06:22.634
- [Toothless roars]
- [Hiccup] Oh, man.

00:06:23.374 --> 00:06:24.418
[gasps] Get down!

00:06:24.592 --> 00:06:28.553
- [roars]
- Run, run!

00:06:30.424 --> 00:06:33.036
No! It's OK! It's OK.

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:34.646
She's a friend.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.649
You just scared him.

00:06:37.823 --> 00:06:40.521
- I scared him?!
- [Toothless growls]

00:06:40.695 --> 00:06:42.697
- Who is "him"?
- Uh...

00:06:42.872 --> 00:06:47.137
Astrid, Toothless.
Toothless, Astrid.

00:06:47.311 --> 00:06:49.574
[snarls]

00:06:52.446 --> 00:06:55.058
[mimics fanfare]
We're dead.

00:06:55.232 --> 00:06:57.712
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Where
do you think you're going?

00:06:59.453 --> 00:07:01.629
[panting]

00:07:04.023 --> 00:07:06.721
Oh, great Odin's ghost!
Oh, this is it!

